      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792065600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "HOW TO READ THIS CONCEPTUAL MODEL",
      "fontSize": 27,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "HOW TO READ THIS CONCEPTUAL MODEL",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "e0309",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 105,
      "y": 4084.0,
      "width": 992.16,
      "height": 23.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 59637,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 246273,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792065600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Rectangles: entities with business attributes. Diamonds: relationships. No SQL types or foreign keys.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Rectangles: entities with business attributes. Diamonds: relationships. No SQL types or foreign keys.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "e0310",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 105,
      "y": 4142.0,
      "width": 1068.48,
      "height": 23.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 59830,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 247070,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792065600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. [ID]: conceptual identity. [unique]: alternate identifier. ?: optional attribute. Composite identities use +.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. [ID]: conceptual identity. [unique]: alternate identifier. ?: optional attribute. Composite identities use +.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "e0311",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 105,
      "y": 4200.0,
      "width": 982.62,
      "height": 23.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 60023,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 247867,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792065600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Multiplicity near an entity counts its instances for ONE instance at the opposite end; N means many.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Multiplicity near an entity counts its instances for ONE instance at the opposite end; N means many.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "e0312",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 105,
      "y": 4258.0,
      "width": 1087.56,
      "height": 23.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 60216,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 248664,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792065600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Customer and Supplier are optional, overlapping User profiles. A user may have both profiles and several roles.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Customer and Supplier are optional, overlapping User profiles. A user may have both profiles and several roles.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "e0313",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 105,
      "y": 4316.0,
      "width": 1030.32,
      "height": 23.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 60409,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 249461,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792065600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. Reservation items refer to physical units from one supplier. startDate and returnDate are both inclusive.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. Reservation items refer to physical units from one supplier. startDate and returnDate are both inclusive.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "e0314",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 105,
      "y": 4374.0,
      "width": 1097.1,
      "height": 23.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 60602,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 250258,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792065600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6. Tool images and physical units are independent sets. Availability and totals are derived, not stored attributes.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6. Tool images and physical units are independent sets. Availability and totals are derived, not stored attributes.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "e0315",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 105,
      "y": 4432.0,
      "width": 839.52,
      "height": 23.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 60795,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 251055,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792065600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "7. Minimum 1 item applies to a reservation with selected units and to an issued invoice.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "7. Minimum 1 item applies to a reservation with selected units and to an issued invoice.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "e0316",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 105,
      "y": 4490.0,
      "width": 1106.64,
      "height": 46.8,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 60988,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 251852,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792065600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "8. UnitDelivery is identified by its ReservationItem; UnitReturn by its delivery. The original composite identity is\npreserved.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "8. UnitDelivery is identified by its ReservationItem; UnitReturn by its delivery. The original composite identity is\npreserved.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "e0317",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 105,
      "y": 4548.0,
      "width": 1020.78,
      "height": 23.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 61181,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 252649,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792065600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "9. Baseline only: 18 entities. Protection, evidence, disputes, refunds and consent extensions are excluded.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "9. Baseline only: 18 entities. Protection, evidence, disputes, refunds and consent extensions are excluded.",
      "autoResize": true,
